## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Transaction cost assumption:** We are assuming 0.2% round-trip (buy + sell) as default. Should this be configurable per strategy, or is 20 bps (which matches your `DEFAULT_TX_COST_BPS=20.0` in `.env`) fine as a hardcoded default?

> [!NOTE]
> **LTCG ₹1.25L exemption:** This exemption is per-financial-year across the entire portfolio, not per stock. We will show it as a footnote ("*LTCG calculations assume exemption already utilized") rather than trying to allocate it per stock, since that would require tracking all user gains across the year.

